WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.667 --> 00:00:12.753
Tina: That’s great, Danny.

2
00:00:12.754 --> 00:00:16.522
But how will a rainbow get us to Ginormous?

3
00:00:16.523 --> 00:00:18.877
Brad: Can’t we just take a bus?

4
00:00:18.878 --> 00:00:20.334
Tina: I get it!

5
00:00:20.335 --> 00:00:22.474
Pay attention, Brad.

6
00:00:22.475 --> 00:00:24.365
Tina: We have to make another key.

7
00:00:24.366 --> 00:00:27.133
And we should use every color.

8
00:00:27.134 --> 00:00:29.720
Brad: But what will that do?

9
00:00:29.721 --> 00:00:32.605
Danny: What did we learn today in class?

10
00:00:32.606 --> 00:00:37.245
Tina: Well, we learned that if you get too upset, you get in trouble.

11
00:00:37.246 --> 00:00:40.136
Danny: Besides that!

12
00:00:40.137 --> 00:00:44.933
Brad: We learned about Roy G. Biv, all the colors of the rainbow.

13
00:00:44.934 --> 00:00:50.825
Tina: Yes. You can make all the colors by mixing red, blue, and yellow.

14
00:00:50.826 --> 00:00:55.355
Danny: Look. What colors of clay do we have?

15
00:00:55.356 --> 00:01:00.243
Brad: Of course! You can make a key with all the colors of the rainbow.

16
00:01:00.244 --> 00:01:04.938
Danny: That’s right. All I have to do is combine them.

17
00:01:04.939 --> 00:01:06.950
Tina: So do it!

18
00:01:06.951 --> 00:01:13.917
Danny: Just watch me!

19
00:01:13.918 --> 00:01:16.642
Tina: I hope that’s a good sign.

20
00:01:16.643 --> 00:01:20.616
Brad: I don’t think the ground shaking can be a good sign.

21
00:01:20.617 --> 00:01:22.426
Danny: You never know!

22
00:01:22.427 --> 00:01:28.495
Tina: Danny, do something!

23
00:01:28.496 --> 00:01:30.782
Danny: That’s more like it!

24
00:01:30.783 --> 00:01:33.974
Tina: Hold on, Hopian! We’re coming!

25
00:01:33.975 --> 00:01:37.255
Brad: I had faith in you the whole time, Danny.

26
00:01:37.256 --> 00:01:48.154
Danny: Yeah. Sure.

27
00:01:48.155 --> 00:01:50.765
Tristay: Those children won’t stop!

28
00:01:50.766 --> 00:01:54.388
Tristay: No matter what happens, they manage to succeed!

29
00:01:54.389 --> 00:01:56.799
Tristay: This is Hopian’s fault.

30
00:01:56.800 --> 00:02:02.914
He invited them to Ginormous.

31
00:02:02.915 --> 00:02:06.237
Tristay: Those children will be here any minute.

32
00:02:06.238 --> 00:02:09.289
Tristay: They might figure out how to defeat me.

33
00:02:09.290 --> 00:02:12.003
Tristay: I can’t let that happen.

34
00:02:12.004 --> 00:02:14.420
They may be smart.

35
00:02:14.421 --> 00:02:19.646
Tristay: But they do not have my powers! Ha-ha-ha!

36
00:02:19.647 --> 00:02:27.898
Tristay: There are plenty of my evil friends to greet them.

37
00:02:27.899 --> 00:02:32.035
Tristay: No matter where they go, you will find them.

38
00:02:32.036 --> 00:02:35.789
Tristay: You will always be there to stop them.

39
00:02:35.790 --> 00:02:38.534
Remember these faces.

40
00:02:38.535 --> 00:02:41.006
Tristay: Beware, they are clever.

41
00:02:41.007 --> 00:02:44.192
Tristay: But they cannot match your strength.

42
00:02:44.193 --> 00:02:49.433
And now, capture them!
